{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vaulting Over It</strong> is a physics based, difficult climbing game where your mistakes are permanent.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Physics-Based Vaulting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/7edd7d5ea3ab4c212a672c6024ef3890.poster.avif?t=1761210190\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/7edd7d5ea3ab4c212a672c6024ef3890.webm?t=1761210190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/7edd7d5ea3ab4c212a672c6024ef3890.mp4?t=1761210190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your branch is both your greatest ally and your worst enemy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Failing as a Feature</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/f8f081ae167dbad5f5fc750f953120ff.poster.avif?t=1761210190\" width=600 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/f8f081ae167dbad5f5fc750f953120ff.webm?t=1761210190\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/f8f081ae167dbad5f5fc750f953120ff.mp4?t=1761210190\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trying is the first step toward failure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3083230/extras/23f0132b8312fd0d7aa85d87a4c67